        - Confirm the claims made above are actually true in practice: that Google Analytics (GA4)
          is the only analytics tool, that vendor confidentiality/data-processing terms are signed,
          and that any non-essential cookies are gated behind consent.
        - Confirm the registered legal name / registration number of the Foundation.
      */}
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>